---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
    title="仙境傳說 — 仙俠 RPG（已下架）"
    description="仙境傳說遊戲已下架。本頁面保留為存檔說明。"
    ogTag="Game"
    bodyPage="game"
>
    <div class="stub-shell">
        <div class="stub-card">
            <div class="stub-icon">🎮</div>
            <h1>仙境傳說 — 仙俠 RPG</h1>
            <p class="stub-eyebrow">本遊戲已下架 · Archived</p>
            <p class="stub-body">
                這套 Godot 4 web export（~36 MB WASM/PCK）因 bundle 過大、不適合長期託管，
                已於 2026-06-12 從站上下架。原始碼保留在 <code>astro/public/games/xian-godot/</code>，
                隨時可以重新建置與上架。
            </p>
            <p class="stub-back">
                <a href="/works/" class="stub-link">← 回作品集</a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</Base>

<style>
    .stub-shell {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        min-height: 100dvh;
        background: #0c0418;
        padding: 2rem 1rem;
        font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, "Microsoft JhengHei", sans-serif;
        color: #c8a060;
    }
    .stub-card {
        max-width: 520px;
        background: rgba(15, 24, 33, 0.84);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.18);
        border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 2.2rem 1.8rem;
        text-align: center;
        box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(122, 92, 30, 0.18);
    }
    .stub-icon { font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .stub-card h1 {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        margin: 0.2rem 0 0.3rem;
        color: #ffd700;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }
    .stub-eyebrow {
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.18em;
        color: #7a5c1e;
        margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .stub-body {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: #c8a060;
        margin: 0 0 1.4rem;
    }
    .stub-body code {
        background: rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.08);
        padding: 0.1em 0.4em;
        border-radius: 3px;
        font-size: 0.85em;
        color: #ffd700;
    }
    .stub-back { margin: 0; }
    .stub-link {
        color: #7a5c1e;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-bottom: 1px dashed #7a5c1e66;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        transition: color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
    }
    .stub-link:hover { color: #ffd700; border-color: #ffd700; }
</style>
